"210","بِسْـمِ اللهِ","","","","","What to say upon receiving pleasing or displeasing news"
"211","أَسْتَـوْدِعُكُـمُ اللَّهَ الَّذي لا تَضـيعُ وَدائِعُـه","","","","","What to say upon receiving pleasing or displeasing news"
